  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>A</mi></math> is the set of even natural numbers less than <math><mtext>8</mtext></math> and <math><mi>B</mi></math> is the set of prime numbers less than <math><mtext>7</mtext></math>, then the number of relations from <math><mi>A</mi></math> to <math><mi>B</mi></math> are"
