    "text": "<math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>{</mo><mn>2,4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>}</mo></math> ; <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> <math><mi>A</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>B</mi></math> contains <math><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math> elements.<br /><br />Hence, the number of relations from <math><mi>A</mi></math> to <math><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></math>."
